message: "If you use CraterSeam in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: "CraterSeam"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rana
    given-names: Jahanzaib
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7085-0440"
