abstract: "A local planetary coordinate debugger built with Rust, Axum, React, and Canvas. Load Parquet or CSV, audit the original values, simulate a strict importer, inspect every finding, and export a reproducible report."
keywords:
  - planetary-science
  - coordinates
  - parquet
  - astronomy
  - data-quality
